AmberChest for Home Assistant

This integration talks to AmberChest — IMAP mail backup in plain .eml files
(https://github.com/sphings79/amberchest), which is licensed under the
AGPL-3.0-or-later. This repository contains no code of that project; it is a
client that speaks to its HTTP API, and is licensed under the MIT licence.

